"1","currencyPrice":0.0157,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20240315_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A226MQ8NRNC_C59461_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20240315_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A226MQ8NRNC_C59461_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20240315_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A226MQ8NRNC_C59461_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/b1d30d497d224ba09bec7e2c6ad65229.svg?t=1710475504","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/f8151fdc728a41ebbc304e11d39e5437.svg?t=1710475504"},"faqs":[{"question":"Is the CL10A226MQ8NRNC Compatible With High-Temperature Automotive Applications?","answer":"No, this capacitor features an X5R temperature coefficient, which operates efficiently within a temperature range of -55°C to +85°C. For harsh high-temperature automotive environments, we recommend choosing a component with a higher temperature rating, such as an X7R or X8R dielectric material."},{"question":"What Alternatives or Replacements From Other Brands Exist for This Part?","answer":"You can find drop-in replacements by searching for other 0603 size multi-layer ceramic capacitors (MLCC) that feature a capacitance of 22uF, a voltage rating of 6.3V or higher, and an X5R temperature coefficient. Major manufacturers like Murata, TDK, and Taiyo Yuden offer equivalent parts that match these specific parameters."},{"question":"What Are the Best Application Scenarios for This Specific Capacitor?","answer":"This 22uF ceramic capacitor is highly optimized for low-voltage decoupling, filtering, and smoothing applications in space-constrained electronic layouts. It is commonly implemented in consumer electronics, power management modules (PMICs), and smartphones where stable, high-capacitance filtering is required in a small footprint."},{"question":"What Are the Core Technical Specifications of This Samsung Component?","answer":"The Samsung Electro-Mechanics CL10A226MQ8NRNC is a multi-layer ceramic capacitor (MLCC) featuring a capacitance of 22uF with a ±20% tolerance. It is rated for a maximum voltage of 6.3V, utilizes an X5R dielectric material, and is packaged in a standard surface-mount 0603 (1608 Metric) package."},{"question":"Are There Any Special Guidelines Regarding the Usage and Implementation of This Capacitor?","answer":"When implementing this surface-mount component, please ensure the absolute maximum operating voltage does not exceed 6.3V. Additionally, because high-capacitance MLCCs are susceptible to DC bias effects (where the effective capacitance drops as the applied DC voltage increases), it is critical to verify the actual capacitance under your operating circuit conditions."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C59461","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1011686","fileName":"ROHS认证@@REACH认证_贴片电容_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/000f26726f147c0f354019287e10b112.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj722098","fileName":"贴片电容(MLCC)指定系列适用_ROHS认证@@HF(无卤素)认证(中文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fca354cf34d48907d73e3bc3817